PINN_learn

This repository contains independent reproduction scripts, experiment
configurations, measurements, and notes for studying physics-informed neural
networks. Those original contributions are made available under Apache-2.0.

The file psi-NN/patches/upstream-local.patch records changes to the upstream
Psi-NN project by Ziti Liu and contributors:
https://github.com/ZitiLiu/Psi-NN
Upstream commit: 2c11ce6df1bcfcf630d05f162d5795d7fa4fdb43
The upstream project is licensed under Apache-2.0. The patch shows which
upstream lines were modified; the upstream repository itself is not included.

The research paper, its PDF, the upstream experimental data, model checkpoints,
and training logs are not redistributed in this repository.
